# CRM DOMAIN RULES (SRS)
## Roles (FR-AUTH-003)
System Administrator, Sales Manager, Sales Representative, Service Representative, Read-Only User.
CRUD permission per entity per role; record sharing: Private, Public Read Only, Public Read/Write.
Users see only records they own or were granted access to.

## Authentication (FR-AUTH-001/002)
Password >= 8 chars with upper/lower/number; lockout after 5 failed attempts; 2-hour inactivity timeout;
optional 30-day remember-me; reset token valid 1 hour; cannot reuse last 5 passwords.

## Leads
Statuses: New (default), Working, Nurturing, Qualified, Unqualified, Converted. Required: Last Name, Company, Status.
Convert: match/create Account, create Contact, optional Opportunity (name required), optionally transfer open
tasks/events, set status Converted, converted leads become read-only, keep links to resulting records. Wrap in a transaction.

## Accounts / Contacts
Account required: Name. Contact required: Last Name + Account. Roll-ups for account hierarchy (employees, revenue).

## Opportunities
Stages -> probability: Qualification 10, Meeting Scheduled 20, Proposal/Price Quote 65, Negotiation/Review 80,
Closed Won 100, Closed Lost 0. Probability auto-updates on stage change; record stage history.
Validation: close date not in the past, amount positive, probability 0-100. Expected revenue = amount x probability.
Delete = archive with confirmation. Clone optionally includes related records.

## Cases
Statuses: New, Working, Escalated, Closed. Required: Status, Origin (Phone/Email/Web/Chat). Closed cases are read-only;
Reopen action available. Priority colours: High red, Medium yellow, Low green.

## Tasks / Events
Task required: Subject; status Not Started/In Progress/Completed/Deferred; priority High/Normal/Low; reminders.
Event required: Subject, start, end (end after start); all-day, private (owner only), show-time-as.
Ownership changes must be logged in the activity timeline and can notify the new owner.
